🔹 First Pass Logic
if (candidate1 == num)
    count1++;


👉 Strengthen candidate1

else if (count1 == 0)
    candidate1 = num;


👉 Pick a new candidate if slot is empty

else {
    count1--;
    count2--;
}


👉 Pairwise elimination (core trick)

🔹 Why Elimination Works 🧠

Removing 3 different elements keeps majority intact
(because majority appears more than n/3)

🔹 Second Pass
count1 = 0;
count2 = 0;


Reset counters to verify actual frequency

